pect me to be the  person responsible for the english  language hong kong covert news i'd never  tried to do that but the information at  the beginning and for a lot of the  outbreak to be honest hasn't been very  good in english there's only a handful  of local newspapers they  don't put stuff out immediately because  it's not their job aaron has met new  people through his platform it's  encouraged him to come out of a shell  i genuinely didn't do it for popularity  because it's a daily job so to do it  every single day for i think we're at  720 days in a row it does get tiresome  but if it does help out one person then  i'm glad that i do it i'm gonna keep  doing it until  it doesn't need to be done anymore  [Music]
 

